# Bonus: saved state survives another command and load restores it.
PROGRAM 4 0 5.00 24 0
COURSE CS1 REGULAR 4 CORE -
STUDENT S1 Asha
REGISTER S1 CS1 1
GRADE S1 CS1 1 B
SAVE tests/bonus_snapshot.tmp
COURSE CS2 REGULAR 2 ELECTIVE -
LOAD tests/bonus_snapshot.tmp
GPA S1
TRANSCRIPT S1
ELIGIBLE S1 CS2 2
